# Next.js + Supabase

Default production template. App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind.

## Layout

- `src/app/` — routes and API handlers
- `src/components/` — UI components
- `src/lib/supabase/` — client, server, middleware helpers
- `src/lib/services/` — business logic (no direct DB in components)
- `src/lib/server/` — server-only utilities
- `supabase/migrations/` — SQL migrations (pgvector-ready)

## Patterns

- AI: `useChat` + route handler in `src/app/api/chat/route.ts` (AI SDK).
- Auth: Supabase Auth helpers; session in middleware.
- Data: service modules call Supabase client; components stay thin.
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`.

## Do not

- Experimental RSC generative UI unless explicitly requested.
- Raw Supabase queries in page components — use services/.
